{"settings": {"templateId": 8887645456647466, "name": "Complaint", "submit": {"lock": true, "pdf": false}, "templateFormUuid": "1118d6aa-6de0-4193-9e24-2693e8caf5e9"}, "layout": [{"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 19}, "text": "", "layout": "default", "localId": "567502de-ed78-415a-9be1-7045bf3e4ea6"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "42facaf0-37c5-40a6-b498-eab29e91d066"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Attorney complaints", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "hardBreak"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Complaints regarding attorneys must be submitted through the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Attorney Complaint website ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "here", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://dbhawaii.org/"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 32}, "text": "", "layout": "default", "localId": "c7ad2ce2-c11d-4262-bb75-9b2cefea7afb"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 2}, "layout": "default", "localId": "557ff357-505f-481c-80b5-6a6e4d56f705"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a7d0ec23-3f51-4b02-aba2-813f347b0db6"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "This form is only for complaints about judges.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "hardBreak"}, {"type": "text", "text": "If your complaint does not concern a judge, this form cannot be submitted."}]}]}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 35}, "layout": "default", "localId": "9e047726-53cc-4b18-8504-a0c0914355b2"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "269fb176-064e-4fd1-842e-a2f5a4137834"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Aloha and welcome!"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f150995e-ae64-47a7-97db-baeed7798f16"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The Commission on Judicial Conduct reviews allegations of misconduct by or disability of Hawai‘i State Court judges.  The Commission applies the Hawai‘i Revised Code of Judicial Conduct ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Code", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://www.courts.state.hi.us/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rcjc_ada.htm)"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "  in its review."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "44c8ee1e-28b6-4f17-aec2-fbe688a69a2b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The Commission is comprised of seven volunteer commissioners who are appointed by the Hawai‘i Supreme Court. The Commission meets monthly so we thank you in advance for your patience as we consider your request for review."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d4c2764b-cfe3-41c9-8e10-b5b898fbcb9e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "To better assist you, the Commission asks that you read the following information carefully before requesting a review:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ea7f887e-7023-40e9-ab35-9ad894ed7e94"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The Commission is only authorized to address judicial conduct or disability allegations."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d5c7186c-f0ba-4ae1-9dd8-cea4f34bfeda"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The Commission has no power to affect case outcomes."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8acb28e3-709f-45c1-89ce-d58c4a72e4a8"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The Commission cannot change a judge’s decisions or potential legal errors."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "750bd115-b34f-443b-a7e6-2c0363725a16"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The Commission cannot change who is assigned as a judge in a specific case.      "}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d6fabd71-f329-4b86-8898-b65a77ca8e81"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The Commission is not an appellate court that reviews complaints of judicial error."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "749ccaa4-b1e5-4923-80ba-0e901f98b6da"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You can only file a request for review of misconduct against Hawai‘i State judges. You cannot use this process to complain about federal judges, attorneys, opposing parties, or other state agencies."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "031f20a7-37a7-4686-8856-8e2de9071bcd"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "After you submit your request for our review, you will receive an acknowledgement that we have received your request. You will be informed when the Commission makes a decision about your request."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "cd50a2f8-846a-44a8-ac25-3521b690b6db"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Please understand that multiple submissions concerning the same facts or issue will significantly slow the Commission’s review process."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a247d6df-1a67-433d-b35d-93ff7af4635a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you have general questions, please refer to our "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Frequently Asked Questions", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://www.courts.state.hi.us/courts/judicial_conduct/commission_on_judicial_conduct"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 33.33}, "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 4}, "layout": "default", "localId": "9ec0f245-7abc-4f7d-9f35-af0acd59e91d"}}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 33.33}, "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 5}, "layout": "default", "localId": "cadc17bf-3e29-45a7-882f-554212f601d9"}}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 33.33}, "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 6}, "layout": "default", "localId": "54f6f998-c342-4b41-97be-1e867feec775"}}]}]}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 23}, "text": "", "layout": "default", "localId": "acee7a23-a4e8-4d99-8c18-31e99a10d938"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 7}, "layout": "default", "localId": "2e4042b8-6c17-440e-89f7-868a0cb40bbf"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 28}, "text": "", "layout": "default", "localId": "df8da32c-2ded-4e57-8327-9b3c678f127b"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 38}, "text": "", "layout": "default", "localId": "a8ef5071-1eb8-42b9-b40e-cf5cbcbbef49"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 29}, "text": "", "layout": "default", "localId": "be54e64d-e2a2-4832-a641-75c37a921727"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 8}, "layout": "default", "localId": "381f2d56-aa5a-4ae4-a09e-c67e34ba438e"}}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 9}, "layout": "default", "localId": "3bafc037-05e5-4cd0-b86a-a0bc7c5fb2e3"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 10}, "layout": "default", "localId": "6c9db2c9-dad6-4200-97c7-39feb0fb031f"}}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 11}, "layout": "default", "localId": "acedfcbe-b3fc-4221-9f3d-669b49ffa120"}}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 45}, "text": "", "layout": "default", "localId": "775558e5-d9c1-45b9-bb64-d15d1b2e34fe"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 48}, "text": "", "layout": "default", "localId": "e6002972-67f3-4a61-ab24-cccd14c8dc8e"}}]}, {"version": 1, "type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 50}, "text": "", "layout": "default", "localId": "5759b88c-00aa-4c70-afae-1fe888ae15c6"}}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 12}, "layout": "default", "localId": "817f71b2-e6f0-4e51-801a-eeb0f85009a6"}}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "warning"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "6bccddcd-6b9c-4807-86b6-1a1e7487edb5"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "When submitting any relevant materials, please submit only copies as these materials become the property of the Commission and will not be returned to you nor will the Commission make copies for you. We accept only PDFs. We are not able to open any links due to security reasons."}]}]}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 13}, "layout": "default", "localId": "de2e6c0f-35c2-4cf1-b0ff-95927b8a5737"}}, {"type": "rule"}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "success"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f86f6329-1259-412c-afc4-b821b86f89c3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Please acknowledge the following rules before submitting your complaint."}]}]}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 14}, "layout": "default", "localId": "6a658852-3198-468a-8df3-ad0247d778f3"}}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 15}, "layout": "default", "localId": "4b639514-2f63-439d-910f-02fa91bd0678"}}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 16}, "layout": "default", "localId": "36340d86-4257-4868-bdfe-b2dbb1c01c30"}}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 17}, "layout": "default", "localId": "61f1adee-919d-4b2c-8255-500518d1b4d4"}}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 18}, "layout": "default", "localId": "72e7c537-e432-4bfe-aedd-00ff2576f563"}}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 39}, "layout": "default", "localId": "17172157-5885-4ffa-b686-6eff99ce7340"}}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"extensionKey": "question", "extensionType": "com.thinktilt.proforma", "parameters": {"id": 40}, "layout": "default", "localId": "fc7d7f0b-41f6-4a8c-9736-426e74254196"}}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "aa7f8bc7-6d92-4368-9c37-9428e1804944"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If your request for review is not within the authority of the Commission, then the matter will be closed and you will be notified of its closure."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "07c25bed-f3ca-4226-a6db-def20874d76b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If your request for review is within the authority of the Commission, the matter will be reviewed. The Commission may request further information from you or from the judge. The Commission will then make a determination and you will be notified when the Commission’s review is complete. As the Commission’s review is strictly confidential, you will not receive the details of the Commission’s determination."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "994af480-4311-4246-be2c-d1fadcf42260"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Resolving your request for review may take several months. The amount of time depends on factors such as the volume of other requests before the Commission and the complexity of your request. If you submit additional material to the Commission, it may delay the processing of your request."}]}]}]}], "conditions": {"34": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"2": ["10182"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "2", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10182"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["10"]}, "t": "sh"}, "51": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"45": ["10198"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "45", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10198"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["11"]}, "t": "sh"}, "33": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"2": ["10182"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "2", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10182"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["7"]}, "t": "sh"}, "22": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"2": ["10182"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "2", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10182"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["4"]}, "t": "sh"}, "24": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"23": ["10184"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "23", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10184"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["5"]}, "t": "sh"}, "21": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"19": ["10181"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "19", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10181"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["2"]}, "t": "sh"}, "54": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"29": ["10189"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "29", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10189"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["9"]}, "t": "sh"}, "31": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"2": ["10183"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "2", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10183"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["3"]}, "t": "sh"}, "53": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"38": ["10187", "10199"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "38", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10187", "10199"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["8"]}, "t": "sh"}, "52": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"2": ["10182"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "2", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10182"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["12"]}, "t": "sh"}, "20": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"19": ["10180"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "19", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10180"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["1"]}, "t": "sh"}, "27": {"i": {"co": {"cIds": {"23": ["10186"]}}, "operator": "OR", "groups": [{"operator": "AND", "checks": [{"fieldId": "23", "type": "SOME_OF", "constraint": ["10186"]}]}]}, "o": {"sIds": ["6"]}, "t": "sh"}}, "sections": {"12": {"name": "judge complaint is yes", "conditions": ["52"]}, "8": {"name": "related to a particular court case or proceeding is yes", "conditions": ["53"]}, "4": {"name": "judge complaint is yes", "conditions": ["22"]}, "5": {"name": "Email", "conditions": ["24"]}, "10": {"name": "judge complaint is yes", "conditions": ["34"]}, "2": {"name": "attorney complaint is no", "conditions": ["21"]}, "7": {"name": "judge complaint is yes", "conditions": ["33"]}, "3": {"name": "judge complaint answer is no", "conditions": ["31"]}, "11": {"name": "Role in Case Details", "conditions": ["51"]}, "9": {"name": "case number", "conditions": ["54"]}, "6": {"name": "mailing address", "conditions": ["27"]}, "1": {"name": "attorney complaint is yes", "conditions": ["20"]}}, "questions": {"45": {"type": "cd", "label": "Your role in this case", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10214", "questionKey": ""}, "12": {"type": "rt", "label": "A clear and brief statement of your allegation(s).", "description": "Please provide information about the judges’ conduct or disability that you would like the Commission to review (please include the date(s) and time(s) of the matters):", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "description", "questionKey": ""}, "8": {"type": "tl", "label": "Your case number(s)", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10210", "questionKey": ""}, "50": {"type": "tl", "label": "How did you learn about the commission?", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10215", "questionKey": ""}, "13": {"type": "at", "label": "Attachments", "description": "You may submit relevant materials such as transcripts to support your claim of judicial misconduct or disability. If you are submitting any relevant materials, please indicate the reference point, such as page number(s). The Commission is able to pull an court transcripts or pleadings. So, you do not need to attach those types of documents.", "validation": {"rq": false}, "choices": [], "questionKey": ""}, "5": {"type": "tl", "label": "Your Middle Name", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": false}, "jiraField": "customfield_10202", "questionKey": ""}, "10": {"type": "da", "label": "Date the misconduct occurred?", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10212", "questionKey": ""}, "48": {"type": "ts", "label": "Explain your role in the case", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10216", "questionKey": ""}, "32": {"type": "ts", "label": "Submission blocked", "description": "Attorney complaints cannot be submitted using this form. Please use the Attorney Complaint website linked above.", "validation": {"rq": true, "rgx": {"p": "a^", "m": "Attorney complaints cannot be submitted using this form."}}, "choices": [], "defaultAnswer": {"text": ""}, "questionKey": ""}, "18": {"type": "cm", "label": "The Commission only looks at whether a state court judge violated the Hawai'i Revised Code of Judicial Conduct. ", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "choices": [{"id": "1", "label": "I understand", "other": false}], "questionKey": ""}, "7": {"type": "te", "label": "Email", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10205", "questionKey": ""}, "29": {"type": "cs", "label": "Do you have a case #?", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10209", "questionKey": ""}, "28": {"type": "rt", "label": "Mailing Address", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10207", "questionKey": ""}, "19": {"type": "cs", "label": "Are you complaining about an attorney?", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10199", "questionKey": ""}, "23": {"type": "cm", "label": "What is your preferred method of contact?", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10204", "questionKey": ""}, "4": {"type": "tl", "label": "Your First Name", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10201", "questionKey": ""}, "40": {"type": "cm", "label": "The Commission does not provide legal advice.  If you have questions or want to know more about the Commission and how it works, please review our FAQ: ", "description": "[https://www.courts.state.hi.us/courts/judicial_conduct/commission_on_judicial_conduct]", "validation": {"rq": true}, "choices": [{"id": "1", "label": "I understand", "other": false}], "questionKey": ""}, "15": {"type": "cm", "label": "The Commission cannot change a judge's decisions or rulings in your case.", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "choices": [{"id": "1", "label": "I understand", "other": false}], "questionKey": ""}, "11": {"type": "tl", "label": "The judge's name(s)", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10213", "questionKey": ""}, "9": {"type": "tl", "label": "The title of your case(s)", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10211", "questionKey": ""}, "35": {"type": "ts", "label": "Submission blocked", "description": "This form cannot be submitted because your complaint is not about a judge.", "validation": {"rq": true, "rgx": {"p": "a^", "m": "This form cannot be submitted unless the complaint is about a judge."}}, "choices": [], "defaultAnswer": {"text": ""}, "questionKey": ""}, "16": {"type": "cm", "label": "The Commission does not evaluate a judge's decisions for factual or legal errors. That is the role of the appellate courts. ", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "choices": [{"id": "1", "label": "I understand", "other": false}], "questionKey": ""}, "6": {"type": "tl", "label": "Your Last Name", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10203", "questionKey": ""}, "39": {"type": "cm", "label": "As required by law, the Commission’s proceedings are confidential.  The Commission may contact the judge(s) involved in your request for review. ", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "choices": [{"id": "1", "label": "I understand", "other": false}], "questionKey": ""}, "17": {"type": "cm", "label": "The Commission cannot intervene in the underlying legal case involved in this matter.", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "choices": [{"id": "1", "label": "I understand", "other": false}], "questionKey": ""}, "14": {"type": "cm", "label": "The Commission cannot change who is the judge in your case.", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "choices": [{"id": "1", "label": "I understand", "other": false}], "questionKey": ""}, "2": {"type": "cs", "label": "Are you complaining about a judge?", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10200", "questionKey": ""}, "38": {"type": "cd", "label": "Was the conduct or disability related to a particular court case or proceeding?", "description": "", "validation": {"rq": true}, "jiraField": "customfield_10208", "questionKey": ""}}}